   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> »millSet« </h1>",
   "body": "<ul><li><strong>Serial number MILLS-00056</strong></li><li><strong>Year 2017</strong></li><li><strong>Manual fine adjustment</strong></li><li><strong>Travel Z axis: 200 mm</strong></li><li><strong>Travel X axis: 200 mm</strong></li><li><strong>Max. Tool diameter: 400 mm</strong></li><li><strong>Axial run-out accuracy: 2 μm</strong></li><li><strong>Tool height: 50 - 200 mm</strong></li><li><strong>Holder for a dial gauge with mounting diameter 8H7</strong></li></ul><p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/demonstration-and-used-appliances/sales-inquiry\">Request a ZOLLER sales inquiry</a></p>",
